The reaction is:

3CO(g) + 3O2(g) → 3CO2(g)

From standard thermodynamic tables, we can find the standard entropies (ΔS°) at 298 K for each compound:

ΔS°(CO) = 195.1 J/mol·K
ΔS°(O2) = 206.1 J/mol·K
ΔS°(CO2) = 233.1 J/mol·K

