\]  
The unrolled diagram of the cone is a sector of a circle with radius $s = 1$. The circumference of the circle is $2\pi s = 2\pi \times 1 = 2\pi$. The circumference of the base of the cone is $2\pi r = 2\pi \times \frac{3}{8} = \frac{3}{4}\pi$.  

