\[
\sigma_{yr} = \frac{1}{2} \times 26 \times 10^9 \times 0.286 \times 10^{-9} \times \frac{10^{-8}}{2}
\]

\[
\sigma_{yr} = \frac{1}{2} \times 26 \times 0.286 \times 10^{-8}
\]

\[
\sigma_{yr} = 0.3718 \text{ MN m}^{-2}
\]

Thus, the tensile yield strength is \(\boxed{0.3718 \text{ MN m}^{-2}}\).
